# Keep the build context small and never send secrets into the image.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets: environment files stay outside the image (only templates are allowed)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# The mobile app is not part of the server image
mobile

# Tooling and docs not needed to build or run
.github
.claude*
**/*.md
!web/README.md
